+	 * @power_mode: One of the following,
+	 *              SDE_MODE_DPMS_ON
+	 *              SDE_MODE_DPMS_LP1
+	 *              SDE_MODE_DPMS_LP2
+	 *              SDE_MODE_DPMS_OFF
+	 * @display: Pointer to private display structure
+	 * Returns: Zero on success
