+/*
+ * Clock tree for generating DSI byte and pixel clocks.
+ *
+ *
+ *                  +---------------+
+ *                  |    vco_clk    |
+ *                  +-------+-------+
+ *                          |
+ *                          |
+ *                  +---------------+
+ *                  |  pll_out_div  |
+ *                  |  DIV(1,2,4,8) |
+ *                  +-------+-------+
+ *                          |
+ *                          +-----------------------------+--------+
+ *                          |                             |        |
+ *                  +-------v-------+                     |        |
+ *                  |  bitclk_src   |                     |        |
+ *                  |  DIV(1..15)   |                     |        |
+ *                  +-------+-------+                     |        |
+ *                          |                             |        |
+ *                          +----------+---------+        |        |
+ *   Shadow Path            |          |         |        |        |
+ *       +          +-------v-------+  |  +------v------+ | +------v-------+
+ *       |          |  byteclk_src  |  |  |post_bit_div | | |post_vco_div  |
+ *       |          |  DIV(8)       |  |  |DIV (2)      | | |DIV(4)        |
+ *       |          +-------+-------+  |  +------+------+ | +------+-------+
+ *       |                  |          |         |      | |        |
+ *       |                  |          |         +------+ |        |
+ *       |                  |          +-------------+  | |   +----+
+ *       |         +--------+                        |  | |   |
+ *       |         |                               +-v--v-v---v------+
+ *     +-v---------v----+                           \  pclk_src_mux /
+ *     \  byteclk_mux /                              \             /
+ *      \            /                                +-----+-----+
+ *       +----+-----+                                       |        Shadow Path
+ *            |                                             |             +
+ *            v                                       +-----v------+      |
+ *       dsi_byte_clk                                 |  pclk_src  |      |
+ *                                                    | DIV(1..15) |      |
+ *                                                    +-----+------+      |
+ *                                                          |             |
+ *                                                          |             |
+ *                                                          +--------+    |
+ *                                                                   |    |
+ *                                                               +---v----v----+
+ *                                                                \  pclk_mux /
+ *                                                                 \         /
+ *                                                                  +---+---+
+ *                                                                      |
+ *                                                                      |
+ *                                                                      v
+ *                                                                   dsi_pclk
+ *
+ */
